1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,828
Every great reading journey starts with a little curiosity.

2
00:00:07,008 --> 00:00:14,261
Meet PageNest, a personal home for the books you want to read, the stories you are reading, and the ones you have finished.

3
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:18,994
Start in Discover.

4
00:00:19,174 --> 00:00:24,443
Search by a book title or an author, or explore a subject that catches your attention.

5
00:00:24,623 --> 00:00:31,429
PageNest brings the catalog into a compact browsing experience, with the essentials visible at a glance.

6
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:36,847
Open a book to take a closer look.

7
00:00:37,027 --> 00:00:42,574
The details sheet brings together its title, author, description, and subjects when available.

8
00:00:42,754 --> 00:00:47,618
You can explore a possible next read without losing your place in the results.

9
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:54,615
When something interests you, add it to your library.

10
00:00:54,795 --> 00:00:58,678
Your saved collection becomes a reading queue you can return to.

11
00:00:58,858 --> 00:01:04,725
The navigation badge keeps that collection close, while the library gives each book a clear place.

12
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:15,681
A reading list becomes more useful when it reflects where you really are.

13
00:01:15,861 --> 00:01:24,373
PageNest separates books you want to read, books you are currently reading, and books you have completed, making the next action easy to see.

14
00:01:25,650 --> 00:01:28,530
Use the status filters to narrow your collection.

15
00:01:28,710 --> 00:01:36,774
Look at your current reads when it is time to pick up a book, or revisit completed titles when you want to reflect on what you have finished.

16
00:01:42,650 --> 00:01:47,279
As your collection grows, search within your library to find a saved book.

17
00:01:47,459 --> 00:01:50,382
Sorting gives you another way to arrange the list.

18
00:01:50,562 --> 00:01:55,191
The aim is simple: spend less time finding your place, and more time reading.

19
00:01:59,650 --> 00:02:03,170
Move a book into Reading and update the page you have reached.

20
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:07,211
The progress bar turns that number into a clear visual checkpoint.

21
00:02:07,391 --> 00:02:12,447
Small page controls help you make quick updates as you continue through a book.

22
00:02:19,500 --> 00:02:22,572
A reading goal gives your collection a little direction.

23
00:02:22,752 --> 00:02:25,632
Set the number of books you would like to finish this year.

24
00:02:25,812 --> 00:02:32,404
PageNest shows your progress toward that target alongside the library, so the bigger picture stays visible.

25
00:02:33,650 --> 00:02:35,954
When you finish a book, mark it Completed.

26
00:02:36,134 --> 00:02:40,721
Your library statistics and goal progress update to reflect the change.

27
00:02:40,901 --> 00:02:45,679
It is a satisfying way to close one reading journey and make room for the next.

28
00:02:50,650 --> 00:02:55,941
Some books leave you with a question, a favorite passage, or a thought you want to remember.

29
00:02:56,121 --> 00:03:03,289
Personal notes keep those reflections attached to the book, turning a list of titles into a more meaningful reading record.

30
00:03:07,650 --> 00:03:10,295
Add a star rating to capture your response.

31
00:03:10,475 --> 00:03:15,361
Together, ratings and notes help you remember more than whether you finished a title.

32
00:03:15,541 --> 00:03:19,829
They preserve a little of what the experience meant to you, in your own words.

33
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:30,551
Switch between light and dark themes from the header.

34
00:03:30,731 --> 00:03:36,299
The same controls and reading information remain familiar, while the colors change around them.

35
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:40,361
Choose the appearance that feels most comfortable for your reading routine.

36
00:03:41,650 --> 00:03:46,962
Your saved library stays on the device, and the app supports browsing it offline.

37
00:03:47,142 --> 00:03:50,449
Discovery still needs a connection to Open Library.

38
00:03:50,629 --> 00:03:57,093
An offline message makes that distinction clear, so you know what is available when connectivity changes.

39
00:03:58,650 --> 00:04:03,557
Return to PageNest and your saved reading information is ready to continue.

40
00:04:03,737 --> 00:04:06,553
Books, progress, notes, and goals stay together.

41
00:04:06,733 --> 00:04:12,791
The Android app also includes reminders and sharing, depending on device permissions and support.

42
00:04:15,650 --> 00:04:17,485
Discover something interesting.

43
00:04:17,665 --> 00:04:19,585
Give it a place in your library.

44
00:04:19,765 --> 00:04:23,221
Track the pages, save the thoughts, and celebrate the finish.

45
00:04:23,401 --> 00:04:28,243
PageNest brings those small moments together into one personal reading journey.

46
00:04:28,423 --> 00:04:30,151
What will your next chapter be?
